PHP can be used for many types of web application functionality.

Some examples include:

### Dynamic Web Pages

PHP can generate content dynamically.

### Form Processing

PHP can collect and process information submitted through HTML forms.

### Database Applications

PHP can communicate with MySQL and other databases.

### E-Commerce

PHP can be used to create shopping carts and other e-commerce functionality.

### User Experiences

PHP can create customized content based on information collected from users.

### Web Tools

PHP can be used to build many types of online tools and applications.

