# 🚀 First Practical Exercise

Create the following project:

```text
C:\xampp\htdocs\php-chapter1
```

Create:

```text
index.php
```

Use:

```php
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>PHP Chapter 1</title>
</head>

<body>

    <h1>Introduction to PHP</h1>

    <?php
        echo "Welcome to PHP & MySQL";
    ?>

</body>

</html>
```

Start Apache in XAMPP and open:

```text
http://localhost/php-chapter1/
```

If Apache is running on port `8080`, open:

```text
http://localhost:8080/php-chapter1/
```

